# mcp-behavior-diff needs NO environment variables and NO API keys.
#
# If the MCP server you are testing needs a credential, do NOT write it in a fixture.
# List the variable NAME under `env_passthrough` in the fixture and export the value in
# your own shell. Names that look like secrets (KEY, TOKEN, SECRET, PASSWORD, ...) also
# require the explicit flag:  mcp-behavior-diff diff fixture.yaml --allow-secret-env NAME
#
# Never commit real values.
